  "releaseNotes": "* Updated to DotExtensions 9.1.0 Preview 2 from 9.0.0 (#110)\n* Updated to Polyfill 9.3.0 from 9.1.0 ( #110 )\n* Fixed a bug where ``IndicesOf`` Immediate mode extensions would return the wrong indices\n* Fixed a bug where ``LastIndexOf`` Immediate mode extensions would not return the last index of the element\n* Fixed a bug where SplitByItemCountEnumerator failed to execute due to an incorrect state configuration\n* Enabled Argument Exception style ThrowIfX Polyfill methods for .NET Standard 2.0\n* Converted some Deferred methods to extension blocks",
